AB  - The proceedings contain 55 papers. The special focus in this conference is on Expert Clouds and Applications. The topics include: IoT-Based Control of Dosa-Making Robot; Classification of Idiomatic Sentences Using AWD-LSTM; developing an IoT-Based Data Analytics System for Predicting Soil Nutrient Degradation Level; a Survey on Cloud Resources Allocation Using Multi-agent System; ioT-Based Smart Helmet for Riders; collision Avoidance in Vehicles Using Ultrasonic Sensor; privacy Challenges and Enhanced Protection in Blockchain Using Erasable Ledger Mechanism; Data Privacy and Security Issues in HR Analytics: Challenges and the Road Ahead; narrow Band Internet of Things as Future Short Range Communication Tool; lightweight Logic Obfuscation in Combinational Circuits for Improved Security—An Analysis; sensitivity Context Aware Privacy Preserving Disease Prediction; analysis of Machine Learning Data Security in the Internet of Things (IoT) Circumstance; convergence of Artificial Intelligence in IoT Network for the Smart City—Waste Management System; energy Aware Load Balancing Algorithm for Upgraded Effectiveness in Green Cloud Computing; review on Health and Productivity Analysis in Soil Moisture Parameters; soft Computing-Based Optimization of pH Control System of Sugar Mill; a Comparative Analysis of Various Data Mining Techniques to Predict Heart Disease; Performance Comparison of Various Controllers in Different SDN Topologies; preprocessing of Datasets Using Sequential and Parallel Approach: A Comparison; blockchain Technology and Academic Certificate Authenticity—A Review; Word Significance Analysis in Documents for Information Retrieval by LSA and TF-IDF using Kubeflow; designing a Smart Speaking System for Voiceless Community; a Detailed Survey on Deep Learning Techniques for Real-Time Image Classification, Recognition and Analysis; NOMA-Based LPWA Networks.
